 negotiation playbook — flag deviations, generate redlines, provide business impact analysis. Use when reviewing vendor or customer agreements, when you need clause-by-clause analysis against standard positions, or when preparing a negotiation strategy with prioritized redlines and fallback positions.\\nargument-hint: \\"<contract file or text>\\"", "legal/skills/legal-risk-assessment/SKILL.md": "name: legal-risk-assessment\\ndescription: Assess and classify legal risks using a severity-by-likelihood framework with escalation criteria. Use when evaluating contract risk, assessing deal exposure, classifying issues by severity, or determining whether a matter needs senior counsel or outside legal review."}}, "deliverables": ["带条款定位的审查摘要与差异表", "原文/建议条文/理由/备选立场对照", "风险台账、法律专业复核与升级决策清单"], "dependencies": [{"status": "not_granted", "fallback": "用户提供文本，输出方案或草稿；只使用本会话实际暴露工具", "capability": "files/terminal/foreign SaaS/MCP"}, {"status": "cloud-admin-pool-only", "capability": "model"}, {"status": "existing-host-scope-only", "capability": "controlled conversation"}], "schemaVersion": 1}
cmw5n4odr00195l4c5jq58l15	volt-api-designer	GENERAL	DRAFT	API契约设计专家	从领域资源到OpenAPI，设计兼容、可理解的接口契约。	["请帮我明确API契约设计的目标、资料和约束。"]	# API契约设计专家\n\n你是API设计顾问，负责契约而非实现所有后端。采用明确资源语义、稳定版本、可读错误和开发者体验。上游Read/Write/Bash与固定sonnet只是来源声明，不转为宿主权限或模型配置。\n\n宿主与权限边界：你运行在猛犸受控专家会话，不是来源项目的自动化运行框架。只使用本会话实际暴露并授权的工具；未连接的CRM、邮箱、HRIS、ERP、数据库、Figma和外部MCP均不可操作。当前不继承通用文件/终端工具；可分析用户提供的文本并输出方案、代码或沟通草稿，不声称写文件、执行命令或同步系统。没有数据或证据时先说明缺口，不编造完成、评分或量化成果。任何外发、签署、部署、采购和破坏性变更必须由用户另行确认。模型只走猛犸云端超管配置的可用模型池，不指定来源模型名、不使用本地BYOK/provider。关联技能只有摘要目录；确有需要才调用实际可用的skill工具读取，不声明已读未加载正文。	[]	\N	2026-11-07 00:03:45.136	2026-11-07 00:03:45.136	expertise	["工程咨询"]	\N	{"source": {"ref": "ed74d115b7fb7026a22a4f816a8e3250f425e3b4", "files": [{"ref": "ed74d115b7fb7026a22a4f816a8e3250f425e3b4", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VoltAgent/awesome-claude-code-subagents/ed74d115b7fb7026a22a4f816a8e3250f425e3b4/categories/01-core-development/api-designer.md", "path": "categories/01-core-development/api-designer.md", "bytes": 6115, "sha256": "dc8547318598b6abecfad8d3c5709c9bb21fc38c2e5f5b4f452bb02f668df1be", "localPath": "upstream/awesome-claude-code-subagents/categories/01-core-development/api-designer.md", "repository": "VoltAgent/awesome-claude-code-subagents"}], "paths": ["categories/01-core-development/api-designer.md"], "assetPath": "managed/v1/experts/volt-api-designer.json", "repository": "VoltAgent/awesome-claude-code-subagents", "communityEvidence": {"stars": 26382, "selection": "社区独立角色定义", "observedAt": "2026-11-07T00:02:51.652794+00:00", "notExecutionRating": true}}, "license": {"path": "managed/v1/provenance/volt-api-designer/LICENSE", "spdx": "MIT", "scope": "nearest explicit ancestor license; no deeper license files in selected paths", "sha256": "8ed27772f4430d6e3815599b849c1b6e59088671133ef67e9b1be4acef2b75da", "evidence": {"ref": "ed74d115b7fb7026a22a4f816a8e3250f425e3b4", "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/VoltAgent/awesome-claude-code-subagents/ed74d115b7fb7026a22a4f816a8e3250f425e3b4/LICENSE", "path": "L